kernel/audit/entry.ts y store-store.ts confirman: AuditAction incluye thought.appended, promotion.executed, state.changed, etc. No incluye reads denegados ni field/classification/allowed. La spec acierta (I13).

actions.ts confirma action-audit con { actionId, taskId, kind, detail, status, hash, createdAt }. No actorId. La spec acierta (I2).

