## 1. Qué fue la fase anterior

F3 cerrada: `assignment.ts`, `flow.ts`, `assignments/*.ts`, `engine/assignments/registry.ts`, `engine/assignments/adapters/*.ts`, `engine/assignments/service.ts`, `engine/assignments/routes.ts`. `AgentTask`/`Monitor`/`Goal`/`SOP` con `assignedBy` y `assignmentKind`. `AgentService` cablea `AssignmentService.assign`. `ActionService` cablea `AssignmentService.approve`/`reject`. `reassign`/`escalate` cablean `AssignmentService`. `sopRoutes` cablea `AssignmentService.assign`. `PersonaRegistry.register` construye `Flow`. `personas/routes.ts` devuelve `flow`. `app.ts` instancia `AssignmentService` y cablea `assignmentsRoutes`. `orchestrator.runGoal` propaga `requestingActorId`.

