### F03.30 — `db-rls.ts`: `withTenantRls` transaccional (1 hunk)

**Fichero:** `apps/server/src/db-rls.ts`
**Marca:** `TENANT_RLS_TX_V1`.

**`$old`:**
```
export async function withTenantRls<T>(
  store: Store,
  tenantId: string,
  fn: () => Promise<T>,
): Promise<T> {
  if (store.backend !== "postgres" || process.env.MULTI_TENANT_SHARED !== "true") {
    return fn();
