# \- 22-canva

# 

# \*\*Cuarto (finanzas):\*\*

# \- 04-holded

# \- 11-holded-tesoreria

# \- 12-odoo-purchase

# \- 20-ramp

# \- 21-stripe

# \- 24-shopify

# 

# \*\*Quinto (personas):\*\*

